Underlying datasets are aggregated from published academic papers
======================================================================

Each dataset directory contains a meta.yaml file with the primary
citation(s). When using a specific dataset, please cite the original
publication in addition to this canonical export. The exact references
are reproduced below for convenience.

COMBVD (Combined Visual Difference dataset)
-------------------------------------------
- Luo, M. R. & Rigg, B. (1987). BFD(l:c) colour-difference formula.
  Color Research & Application 12, 154-158.
- Kim, H. & Nobbs, J. (1997). New weighting functions for the weighted
  CIELAB colour difference formula. AIC Color 97.
- Berns, R. S., Alman, D. H., Reniff, L., Snyder, G. D. &
  Balonon-Rosen, M. R. (1991). Visual determination of suprathreshold
  color-difference tolerances using probit analysis. Color Research &
  Application 16, 297-316.
- Witt, K. (1999). Geometric relations between scales of small colour
  differences. Color Research & Application 24, 78-92.

MacAdam 1942 (Ellipses)
-----------------------
- MacAdam, D. L. (1942). Visual Sensitivities to Color Differences in
  Daylight. Journal of the Optical Society of America 32(5), 247-274.
- Snapshot from colour.DATA_MACADAM_1942_ELLIPSES (BSD-3 source data).

MacAdam 1974 (OSA UCS)
----------------------
- MacAdam, D. L. (1974). Uniform color scales. Journal of the Optical
  Society of America 64(12), 1691-1702.

MacAdam 1935 (Optimal Color Stimuli)
------------------------------------
- MacAdam, D. L. (1935). Maximum visual efficiency of colored materials.
  Journal of the Optical Society of America 25(11), 361-367.
- Snapshot from colour.volume.datasets.OPTIMAL_COLOUR_STIMULI_ILLUMINANTS.

Breneman 1987 (Corresponding Colors)
------------------------------------
- Breneman, E. J. (1987). Corresponding chromaticities for different
  states of adaptation to complex visual fields. Journal of the Optical
  Society of America A 4(6), 1115-1129.
- Snapshot from colour.BRENEMAN_EXPERIMENTS (BSD-3 source data).

Corresponding-Colour Datasets (Luo & Rhodes 1999)
-------------------------------------------------
- Luo, M. R. & Rhodes, P. A. (1999). Corresponding-colour datasets.
  Color Research & Application 24(4), 295-296.
- Bundle includes: Breneman 1987, CSAJ (Color Science Association of
  Japan), Helson 1938, Hunt-via-LUTCHI, Kuo, Lam, McCann mondrian, RIT
  1-4, Stevens-style scalings. Cite each experiment's original authors
  when using its data.
- Snapshot from Zenodo DOI 10.5281/zenodo.3270903 (license unspecified
  by uploader; included for research convenience under the academic-use
  convention).

LUTCHI Colour Appearance Data (Luo & Rhodes 1997)
-------------------------------------------------
- Luo, M. R., Clarke, A. A., Rhodes, P. A., Schappo, A., Scrivener, S. A.
  R. & Tait, C. J. (1991). Quantifying colour appearance. Part I.
  LUTCHI colour appearance data. Color Research & Application 16(3),
  166-180.
- Snapshot from Zenodo DOI 10.5281/zenodo.4394536 (license unspecified
  by uploader; included for research convenience under the academic-use
  convention).

xkcd Color Survey
-----------------
- Munroe, R. (2010). Color Survey Results.
  https://blog.xkcd.com/2010/05/03/color-survey-results/
- Curated 950-color list snapshot from https://xkcd.com/color/rgb.txt
  (CC0 public domain dedication per file header).

He 2022 (3D-printed samples)
----------------------------
- He, R., Xiao, K., Pointer, M., Bressler, Y., Liu, Z. & Lu, Y. (2022).
  Development of an Image-Based Measurement System for Human Facial
  Skin Colour. Color Research & Application.

HelmlabFB (self-collected, pseudonymized)
-----------------------------------------
- helmlab (https://helmlab.space), 2026. Mobile-web color-difference
  test, 71 observers, observer identities pseudonymized.

Hung-Berns 1995
---------------
- Hung, P.-C. & Berns, R. S. (1995). Determination of constant hue loci
  for a CRT gamut and their predictions using color appearance spaces.
  Color Research & Application 20(5), 285-295.

Ebner-Fairchild 1998
--------------------
- Ebner, F. & Fairchild, M. D. (1998). Finding constant hue surfaces in
  color space. Proc. SPIE 3300, 107-117.

Pointer 1980
------------
- Pointer, M. R. (1980). The gamut of real surface colours. Color
  Research & Application 5(3), 145-155.

Munsell Renotation
------------------
- Newhall, S. M., Nickerson, D. & Judd, D. B. (1943). Final report of
  the OSA subcommittee on the spacing of the Munsell colors. Journal of
  the Optical Society of America 33(7), 385-418.
- Snapshot generated from the `colour` Python library
  (MUNSELL_COLOURS_REAL).
